{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banshee Bash</strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced local multiplayer party royale! Team up or go solo in hectic free-for-all battles. Stack spell books to create unbalanced chaos and grab potion bottles to stay in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Playable Characters</strong> \u2013 Choose your favorite Halloween themed avatar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Spell Upgrades</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match spells and modifiers to tailor playstyles and create overpowered combinations</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free For All</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 Battle across diverse arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Cosmetics</strong> \u2013 Customize your character with stylish rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Players</strong>\u00a0<strong>Battles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Bring the whole party! <i>(Windows currently limits controller connections to 4, but bots can fill the rest).</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>BASH!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395730?t=1771563174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395730?t=1771563174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395730/30e9e9f501dedf55a09dbcb8dfbfda504b73a7d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771563174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395730/30e9e9f501dedf55a09dbcb8dfbfda504b73a7d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771563174","categories":[{"description":"Sing